{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/coral-reef","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":811,"crm_id":null,"search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Coral Reef","slug":"coral-reef","display_address":"Maritime City","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Damac Properties","price":1600000,"display_price":"1.6M","lattitude":25.2653471,"longitude":55.2924914,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Embark on a remarkable journey to the enchanting realm of Coral Reef, an architectural marvel within Dubai Maritime City meticulously crafted by Damac Properties. A symphony of luxury and artistic expression, Coral Reef is a testament to the convergence of luxury and creativity. This visionary residential project introduces an elevated waterfront lifestyle, where the rhythm of the sea harmonizes with contemporary living, creating a space that redefines modern elegance.</p><p>Nestled within this vibrant canvas, Coral Reef unveils a unique chapter of luxury living. Here, the charm of upscale residences harmonizes with the allure of exclusive Babolex sculptures, a creation of acclaimed French artist Vincent Faudemer. This artistic collaboration renders Coral Reef a singular experience, where each sculpture becomes a distinctive symbol of wonder within the tower’s graceful embrace. Beyond the artistic expressions, Coral Reef unfolds a series of offerings that redefine modern living. With a selection of carefully designed <strong>1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments</strong>, residents are presented with choices that suit their preferences and needs. From top-notch amenities that redefine comfort to meticulously crafted interiors that exude contemporary elegance, every facet has been thoughtfully curated to provide an unmatched living experience.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https:/